{"ticker":{"symbol":"ORKA","name":"Oruka Therapeutics, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":100.605,"change_pct":0.04775046865236421,"market_cap":6661027328.0,"pe":-35.15052,"pb":5.52714,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":25.23,"week52_high":115.52,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","city":"Menlo Park","employees":68,"website":"https://orukatx.com","business_summary":"Oruka Therapeutics, Inc., a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company, focuses on developing novel monoclonal antibody therapeutics for psoriasis (PsO), and other inflammatory and immunology (I&I) indications. Its lead products include ORKA-001 that targets p19 subunit of interleukin-23, which is in phase 2a trial for the treatment of PsO; and ORKA-002 that targets interleukin-17A and interleukin-17F, which is in phase 2 trial for the treatment of PsO, psoriatic arthritis, and other conditions. The company also develops ORKA-003 for targeting an undisclosed pathway; and ORKA-021, a sequential combination regimen of ORKA-002 and ORKA-001. Oruka Therapeutics, Inc. is headquartered in Menlo Park, California.","business_summary_ko":"임상 단계의 바이오제약 회사인 Oruka Therapeutics, Inc.는 건선(PsO) 및 기타 염증 및 면역학(I&I) 적응증에 대한 새로운 단일클론 항체 치료제 개발에 중점을 두고 있습니다. 주요 제품으로는 PsO 치료를 위한 2a상 시험이 진행 중인 인터루킨-23의 p19 하위 단위를 표적으로 하는 ORKA-001; 그리고 인터루킨-17A와 인터루킨-17F를 표적으로 삼는 ORKA-002는 PsO, 건선성 관절염 및 기타 질환의 치료를 위한 2상 시험이 진행 중입니다. 이 회사는 또한 공개되지 않은 경로를 목표로 하는 ORKA-003을 개발합니다. 및 ORKA-002 및 ORKA-001의 순차적 조합 요법인 ORKA-021. Oruka Therapeutics, Inc.는 캘리포니아주 멘로파크에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":0.0,"n":9,"eps":-2.36632,"eps_lo":-2.9,"eps_hi":-1.83,"eps_g":-0.2791},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":0.0,"n":9,"eps":-2.86212,"eps_lo":-4.09,"eps_hi":-2.19104,"eps_g":-0.20950001}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2025","revenue":0.0,"operating_income":-1220510